title: "Sign Language Interpreter: Real-Time Multimodal ASL Recognition and Sensor Fusion Platform"
abstract: "An open-source assistive human-computer interaction system combining computer vision landmark tracking, on-device deep learning neural networks, and ESP32 IMU smart glove sensor fusion for real-time sign language recognition and translation."
